Z||000000||polomeno||01-09-2001||06:09 PM||||Hey guys .. i recently blew a rod on my 84 2.5 4 Cyl fiero ... i was calling around for different engine prices and was told that a 88 pontiac 6000 2.5 L engine is the exact same and would fit??  is this true? i also heard Omega's and Phoenix's would also fit? could someone tell me what others cars i could get engine's from to replace my 84 2.5 L .. <P>Thanks Guys<P>John||||reg||1
Z||000001||theogre||01-09-2001||07:21 PM||||88 2.5l are nearly all DIS ignition. it will fit only physically. You'll have to change all sorts of things for it to run.||||reg||1
